# State records the infrastructure, and can hold values you would not paste in
# public. It is not needed to rebuild — `terraform import` or a fresh apply will
# do — so it stays out of the repo.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
*.tfvars
!example.tfvars

# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored: it pins provider versions
# so a rebuild resolves the same code. Commit it.
